Agreed. Git has one maintainer, Junio Hamano, who applies every patch
from mail. The exceptions are a few subtrees (git-gui, gitk, po/) whose
own maintainers send him merges. That is close to you on trunk with
agents and others posting to lab-devel.

> I'd like an overview of the model, useful links, and ideas for how to
